Stateful Inspection Firewall
Goal: Show that stateful firewall only allows return traffic for established connections.
Steps with iptables conntrack:
Allow ESTABLISHED traffic:
sudo iptables -A INPUT -m conntrack --ctstate ESTABLISHED,RELATED -j ACCEPT
Deny all new inbound traffic:
sudo iptables -A INPUT -m conntrack --ctstate NEW -j DROP
Ping or curl from client:
